# Glimmer of Life (WotG 44) after Pillar of Hope. Pillar of Hope's 28 [89, 23, 1743], finished with option 1, makes
# Glimmer of Life current with Timer 8001 and mustZone 89. Both block: DefaultActions MYSTERIOUS_COLUMN_ROTATES (8387).
# A warp to Batallia Downs [S] clears the mustZone; back in Grauberg [S] the Timer (8001) is still ahead: 8387 again. A
# wait of 24 Vana'diel hours makes the day 8001, the Timer's own day: 34 [89, 23, 1756]; its finish completes the
# mission (Time Slips Away current).
lists GraubergS/Veridical_Conflux/onTrigger GraubergS/onEventFinish/28 GraubergS/onEventFinish/34
char zone=GraubergS pos=-140.28,-6.749,585.24 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
mission Wotg PillarOfHope current
login
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # Pillar of Hope's 28
finish option=1                            # Glimmer of Life current, Timer day + 1, mustZone
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # both block
finish-if-event
warp -48,0,435 BatalliaDownsS              # another zone: mustZone cleared
warp -140.28,-6.749,585.24 GraubergS
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # the Timer still ahead
finish-if-event
wait vana=24                               # the next day: Timer == the day
trigger Veridical_Conflux                  # 34
finish                                     # completed
